INFO 2024-07-28 20:23:34,174 basehttp "OPTIONS /api/chat?current_message=%7B%22role%22:%22user%22,%22content%22:%22I+want+a+book+about+a+circus+with+a+dark+history%22,%22image%22:null%7D&matches=[%7B%22id%22:%2214513658%22,%22score%22:0.869778454,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Genevieve+Valentine%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.8279261589050293,%22description%22:%22Come+inside+and+take+a+seat%3B+the+show+is+about+to+begin...%5CnOutside+any+city+still+standing,+the+Mechanical+Circus+Tresaulti+sets+up+its+tents.+Crowds+pack+the+benches+to+gawk+at+the+brass-and-copper+troupe+and+their+impossible+feats:+Ayar+the+Strong+Man,+the+acrobatic+Grimaldi+Brothers,+fearless+Elena+and+her+aerialists+who+perform+on+living+trapezes.+War+is+everywhere,+but+while+the+Circus+is+performing,+the+world+is+magic.%5CnThat+magic+is+no+accident:+Boss+builds+her+circus+from+the+bones+out,+molding+a+mechanical+company+that+will+survive+the+unforgiving+landscape.%5CnBut+even+a+careful+ringmaster+can+make+mistakes.%5CnTwo+of+Tresaulti%27s+performers+are+entangled+in+a+secret+standoff+that+threatens+to+tear+the+circus+apart+just+as+the+war+lands+on+their+doorstep.+Now+the+Circus+must+fight+a+war+on+two+fronts:+one+from+the+outside,+and+a+more+dangerous+one+from+within.%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1327894412m%2F9626382.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:2435,%22title%22:%22Mechanique:+A+Tale+of+the+Circus+Tresaulti%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%2253543599%22,%22score%22:0.867386937,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Ellen+Marie+Wiseman%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.960629940032959,%22description%22:%22From+acclaimed+author+Ellen+Marie+Wiseman+comes+a+vivid,+daring+novel+about+the+devastating+power+of+family+secrets--beginning+in+the+poignant,+lurid+world+of+a+Depression-era+traveling+circus+and+coming+full+circle+in+the+transformative+1950s.%5CnOn+a+summer+evening+in+1931,+Lilly+Blackwood+glimpses+circus+lights+from+the+grimy+window+of+her+attic+bedroom.+Lilly+isn%27t+allowed+to+explore+the+meadows+around+Blackwood+Manor.+She%27s+never+even+ventured+beyond+her+narrow+room.+Momma+insists+it%27s+for+Lilly%27s+own+protection,+that+people+would+be+afraid+if+they+saw+her.+But+on+this+unforgettable+night,+Lilly+is+taken+outside+for+the+first+time--and+sold+to+the+circus+sideshow.%5CnMore+than+two+decades+later,+nineteen-year-old+Julia+Blackwood+has+inherited+her+parents%27+estate+and+horse+farm.+For+Julia,+home+was+an+unhappy+place+full+of+strict+rules+and+forbidden+rooms,+and+she+hopes+that+returning+might+erase+those+painful+memories.+Instead,+she+becomes+immersed+in+a+mystery+involving+a+hidden+attic+room+and+photos+of+circus+scenes+featuring+a+striking+young+girl.%5CnAt+first,+The+Barlow+Brothers%27+Circus+is+just+another+prison+for+Lilly.+But+in+this+rag-tag,+sometimes+brutal+world,+Lilly+discovers+strength,+friendship,+and+a+rare+affinity+for+animals.+Soon,+thanks+to+elephants+Pepper+and+JoJo+and+their+handler,+Cole,+Lilly+is+no+longer+a+sideshow+spectacle+but+the+circus%27s+biggest+attraction.+.+.until+tragedy+and+cruelty+collide.+It+will+fall+to+Julia+to+learn+the+truth+about+Lilly%27s+fate+and+her+family%27s+shocking+betrayal,+and+find+a+way+to+make+Blackwood+Manor+into+a+place+of+healing+at+last.%5CnMoving+between+Julia+and+Lilly%27s+stories,+Ellen+Marie+Wiseman+portrays+two+extraordinary,+very+different+women+in+a+novel+that,+while+tender+and+heartbreaking,+offers+moments+of+joy+and+indomitable+hope.%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1483427018m%2F32926258.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:3683,%22title%22:%22The+Life+She+Was+Given%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%224812858%22,%22score%22:0.867133319,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Will+Elliott%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.836831569671631,%22description%22:%22%5C%22You+have+two+days+to+pass+your+audition.+You+better+pass+it,+feller.+You%27re+joining+the+circus.+Ain%27t+that+the+best+news+you+ever+got%3F%5C%22%5CnDelivered+by+a+trio+of+psychotic+clowns,+this+ultimatum+plunges+Jamie+into+the+horrific+alternate+universe+that+is+the+centuries-old+Pilo+Family+Circus,+a+borderline+world+between+Hell+and+Earth+from+which+humankind%27s+greatest+tragedies+have+been+perpetrated.+Yet+in+this+place--peopled+by+the+gruesome,+grotesque,+and+monstrous--where+violence+and+savagery+are+the+norm,+Jamie+finds+that+his+worst+enemy+is+himself.%5CnWhen+he+applies+the+white+face+paint,+he+is+transformed+into+JJ,+the+most+vicious+clown+of+all.+And+JJ+wants+Jamie+dead!%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1331518851m%2F4748221.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:2525,%22title%22:%22The+Pilo+Family+Circus%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%2219161274%22,%22score%22:0.863938749,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Laura+Lam%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.9112730026245117,%22description%22:%22In+a+land+of+lost+wonders,+the+past+is+stirring+once+more+.+.+.%5CnGene%27s+life+resembles+a+debutante%27s+dream.+Yet+she+hides+a+secret+that+would+see+her+shunned+by+the+nobility.+Gene+is+both+male+and+female.+Then+she+displays+unwanted+magical+abilities+-+last+seen+in+mysterious+beings+from+an+almost-forgotten+age.+Matters+escalate+further+when+her+parents+plan+a+devastating+betrayal,+so+she+flees+home,+dressed+as+a+boy.%5CnThe+city+beyond+contains+glowing+glass+relics+from+a+lost+civilization.+They+call+to+her,+but+she+wants+freedom+not+mysteries.+So,+reinvented+as+%27Micah+Grey%27,+Gene+joins+the+circus.+As+an+aerialist,+she+discovers+the+joy+of+flight+-+but+the+circus+has+a+dark+side.+She%27s+also+plagued+by+visions+foretelling+danger.+A+storm+is+howling+in+from+the+past,+but+will+she+heed+its+roar%3F%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1461082527m%2F29502206.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:2333,%22title%22:%22Pantomime+(Micah+Grey,+%231)%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%22544373%22,%22score%22:0.862330496,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Enid+Blyton%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.9685165882110596,%22description%22:%22A+caravan+holiday+for+the+Famous+Five+is+bound+to+be+an+adventure!+And+when+they+stumble+across+a+circus+troupe,+the+gang+are+thrilled.+But+some+of+the+circus+people+have+more+sinister+plans+than+just+clowning+around...%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fs.gr-assets.com%2Fassets%2Fnophoto%2Fbook%2F111x148-bcc042a9c91a29c1d680899eff700a03.png%22,%22ratings_count%22:9370,%22title%22:%22Five+Go+Off+in+a+Caravan+(Famous+Five,+%235)%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%2241824344%22,%22score%22:0.860772491,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Cassie+Beasley%22,%22avg_rating%22:4.102207660675049,%22description%22:%22Fans+of+Big+Fish,+Peter+Pan,+and+Roald+Dahl+will+fall+in+love+with+Circus+Mirandus,+which+celebrates+the+power+of+seeing+magic+in+world.%5CnDo+you+believe+in+magic%3F%5CnMicah+Tuttle+does.%5CnEven+though+his+awful+Great-Aunt+Gertrudis+doesn%27t+approve,+Micah+believes+in+the+stories+his+dying+Grandpa+Ephraim+tells+him+of+the+magical+Circus+Mirandus:+the+invisible+tiger+guarding+the+gates,+the+beautiful+flying+birdwoman,+and+the+magician+more+powerful+than+any+other--the+Man+Who+Bends+Light.+Finally,+Grandpa+Ephraim+offers+proof.+The+Circus+is+real.+And+the+Lightbender+owes+Ephraim+a+miracle.+With+his+friend+Jenny+Mendoza+in+tow,+Micah+sets+out+to+find+the+Circus+and+the+man+he+believes+will+save+his+grandfather.%5CnThe+only+problem+is,+the+Lightbender+doesn%27t+want+to+keep+his+promise.+And+now+it%27s+up+to+Micah+to+get+the+miracle+he+came+for.%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1462663576m%2F23281919.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:6477,%22title%22:%22Circus+Mirandus%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%221868553%22,%22score%22:0.85680294,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Ray+Bradbury%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.888268232345581,%22description%22:%22%5C%22A+fast-moving,+eerie...tale+set+on+Halloween+night.+Eight+costumed+boys+running+to+meet+their+friend+Pipkin+at+the+haunted+house+outside+town+encounter+instead+the+huge+and+cadaverous+Mr.+Moundshroud.+As+Pipkin+scrambles+to+join+them,+he+is+swept+away+by+a+dark+Something,+and+Moundshroud+leads+the+boys+on+the+tail+of+a+kite+through+time+and+space+to+search+the+past+for+their+friend+and+the+meaning+of+Halloween.+After+witnessing+a+funeral+procession+in+ancient+Egypt,+cavemen+discovering+fire,+Druid+rites,+the+persecution+of+witches+in+the+Dark+Ages,+and+the+gargoyles+of+Notre+Dame,+they+catch+up+with+the+elusive+Pipkin+in+the+catacombs+of+Mexico,+where+each+boy+gives+one+year+from+the+end+of+his+life+to+save+Pipkin%27s.+Enhanced+by+appropriately+haunting+black-and-white+drawings.%5C%22--Booklist%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1320398641m%2F761381.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:13425,%22title%22:%22The+Halloween+Tree%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%22202999%22,%22score%22:0.85632962,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Dr.+Seuss%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.9219858646392822,%22description%22:%22Step+right+up+for+Dr.+Seuss%27s+classic+rhyming+picture-book+tale+of+young+Morris+McGurk%27s+big+circus+dreams.+This+circus+has+more+than+a+mere+lion+tamer+and+trapeze+artist!+At+the+Circus+McGurkus,+you%27ll+be+intrigued+by+the+wink-hooded+Hoodwink,+terrified+by+the+Spotted+Atrocious,+and+amazed+by+the+daring+feats+of+the+great+Sneelock.+And+these+are+just+a+few+of+the+astonishing+things+you%27ll+find+under+this+big+top.+Told+with+the+humor+and+originality+that+are+synonymous+with+Dr.+Seuss,+If+I+Ran+the+Circusis+a+crowd-pleasing+showstopper!%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fs.gr-assets.com%2Fassets%2Fnophoto%2Fbook%2F111x148-bcc042a9c91a29c1d680899eff700a03.png%22,%22ratings_count%22:4230,%22title%22:%22If+I+Ran+the+Circus%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%2246014585%22,%22score%22:0.854411781,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Louisa+May+Alcott%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.7265422344207764,%22description%22:%22This+is+the+story+of+two+runaways+--+Ben+Brown+and+his+dog,+Sancho+--+who+have+escaped+from+a+hard+life+in+the+circus+to+search+for+Ben%27s+lost+father.+Tired+and+hungry,+the+pair+are+taken+in+by+young+Bab+and+Betty+Moss+and+their+mother,+as+well+as+by+the+Mosses%27+neighbors,+Miss+Celia+and+her+brother,+Thorny.+Thanks+to+their+kindness,+Ben+soon+has+a+job,+a+family,+and+a+chance+to+go+to+school.+But+can+life+with+Miss+Celia+and+his+other+new+friends+ever+compare+to+the+excitement+of+the+circus%3F+And+will+Ben+stay+out+of+mischief+long+enough+to+find+out%3F%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fs.gr-assets.com%2Fassets%2Fnophoto%2Fbook%2F111x148-bcc042a9c91a29c1d680899eff700a03.png%22,%22ratings_count%22:3858,%22title%22:%22Under+the+Lilacs%22%7D%7D] HTTP/1.1" 200 0
