er+instead+the+huge+and+cadaverous+Mr.+Moundshroud.+As+Pipkin+scrambles+to+join+them,+he+is+swept+away+by+a+dark+Something,+and+Moundshroud+leads+the+boys+on+the+tail+of+a+kite+through+time+and+space+to+search+the+past+for+their+friend+and+the+meaning+of+Halloween.+After+witnessing+a+funeral+procession+in+ancient+Egypt,+cavemen+discovering+fire,+Druid+rites,+the+persecution+of+witches+in+the+Dark+Ages,+and+the+gargoyles+of+Notre+Dame,+they+catch+up+with+the+elusive+Pipkin+in+the+catacombs+of+Mexico,+where+each+boy+gives+one+year+from+the+end+of+his+life+to+save+Pipkin%27s.+Enhanced+by+appropriately+haunting+black-and-white+drawings.%5C%22--Booklist%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1320398641m%2F761381.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:13425,%22title%22:%22The+Halloween+Tree%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%22202999%22,%22score%22:0.85632962,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Dr.+Seuss%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.9219858646392822,%22description%22:%22Step+right+up+for+Dr.+Seuss%27s+classic+rhyming+picture-book+tale+of+young+Morris+McGurk%27s+big+circus+dreams.+This+circus+has+more+than+a+mere+lion+tamer+and+trapeze+artist!+At+the+Circus+McGurkus,+you%27ll+be+intrigued+by+the+wink-hooded+Hoodwink,+terrified+by+the+Spotted+Atrocious,+and+amazed+by+the+daring+feats+of+the+great+Sneelock.+And+these+are+just+a+few+of+the+astonishing+things+you%27ll+find+under+this+big+top.+Told+with+the+humor+and+originality+that+are+synonymous+with+Dr.+Seuss,+If+I+Ran+the+Circusis+a+crowd-pleasing+showstopper!%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fs.gr-assets.com%2Fassets%2Fnophoto%2Fbook%2F111x148-bcc042a9c91a29c1d680899eff700a03.png%22,%22ratings_count%22:4230,%22title%22:%22If+I+Ran+the+Circus%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%2246014585%22,%22score%22:0.854411781,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Louisa+May+Alcott%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.7265422344207764,%22description%22:%22This+is+the+story+of+two+runaways+--+Ben+Brown+and+his+dog,+Sancho+--+who+have+