+of+psychotic+clowns,+this+ultimatum+plunges+Jamie+into+the+horrific+alternate+universe+that+is+the+centuries-old+Pilo+Family+Circus,+a+borderline+world+between+Hell+and+Earth+from+which+humankind%27s+greatest+tragedies+have+been+perpetrated.+Yet+in+this+place--peopled+by+the+gruesome,+grotesque,+and+monstrous--where+violence+and+savagery+are+the+norm,+Jamie+finds+that+his+worst+enemy+is+himself.%5CnWhen+he+applies+the+white+face+paint,+he+is+transformed+into+JJ,+the+most+vicious+clown+of+all.+And+JJ+wants+Jamie+dead!%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1331518851m%2F4748221.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:2525,%22title%22:%22The+Pilo+Family+Circus%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%2219161274%22,%22score%22:0.863938749,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Laura+Lam%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.9112730026245117,%22description%22:%22In+a+land+of+lost+wonders,+the+past+is+stirring+once+more+.+.+.%5CnGene%27s+life+resembles+a+debutante%27s+dream.+Yet+she+hides+a+secret+that+would+see+her+shunned+by+the+nobility.+Gene+is+both+male+and+female.+Then+she+displays+unwanted+magical+abilities+-+last+seen+in+mysterious+beings+from+an+almost-forgotten+age.+Matters+escalate+further+when+her+parents+plan+a+devastating+betrayal,+so+she+flees+home,+dressed+as+a+boy.%5CnThe+city+beyond+contains+glowing+glass+relics+from+a+lost+civilization.+They+call+to+her,+but+she+wants+freedom+not+mysteries.+So,+reinvented+as+%27Micah+Grey%27,+Gene+joins+the+circus.+As+an+aerialist,+she+discovers+the+joy+of+flight+-+but+the+circus+has+a+dark+side.+She%27s+also+plagued+by+visions+foretelling+danger.+A+storm+is+howling+in+from+the+past,+but+will+she+heed+its+roar%3F%22,%22image_url%22:%22https:%2F%2Fimages.gr-assets.com%2Fbooks%2F1461082527m%2F29502206.jpg%22,%22ratings_count%22:2333,%22title%22:%22Pantomime+(Micah+Grey,+%231)%22%7D%7D,%7B%22id%22:%22544373%22,%22score%22:0.862330496,%22values%22:[],%22metadata%22:%7B%22author_name%22:%22Enid+Blyton%22,%22avg_rating%22:3.96851